---
// Overrides Starlight's default ThemeProvider to force light theme site-wide.
// Paired with ThemeSelectEmpty.astro (which hides the light/dark toggle) so
// /resources always matches the rest of the site's light theme — avoids a
// light/dark variable mismatch (e.g. dark-mode text colors rendered against
// our forced-light background).
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
</script>
